      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "sub_sub_header",
   "id": "97d33b83-5bff-4495-b76f-9b6c6dbae047",
   "r": [
    [
     "Materials",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ],
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal_background"
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "a8455e7e-52c5-4ece-87fc-c0ed63d0e45c",
   "r": [
    [
     "Untitled"
    ]
   ],
   "file": "layout-materials/05.jpg",
   "w": 1600,
   "h": 900
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "a3054382-a0d5-46c3-974b-3bb82be37460",
   "r": [
    [
     "材质这一章比较简单，只讲几点："
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "68170ee6-eee9-40b9-9023-2b3c85470494",
   "r": [
    [
     "What 是什么",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "8c4b0d43-33c3-4478-87c4-84c2cc73eee8",
   "r": [
    [
     "一种视觉效果，在系统中通过在文本、图标的背景上，向界面下一层的背景提取颜色并显示出来，通常是毛玻璃效果，以达到增强画面的深度感。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "d7611743-d6fc-42ed-8d92-531c3a590d2e",
   "r": [
    [
     "系统的背景层分为了语义化的四种：透明度由低到高为 Thick、Regular、Thin 和 Ultrathin , 其中 Regular 为默认。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "7d954881-3a09-4e02-8c65-15c832a9c5b1",
   "r": [
    [
     "Untitled"
    ]
   ],
   "file": "layout-materials/06.jpg",
   "w": 1600,
   "h": 1168
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "5c34bd2e-6990-4b9b-a4ce-9958a76172fd",
   "r": [
    [
     "图源：@fenx",
     [
      [
       "h",
       "gray"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "91a6f285-68d7-4258-9de7-f98f90e916bb",
   "r": [
    [
     "Why 为什么",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quote",
   "id": "166fd422-259c-4b09-92db-1adfd6f85d69",
   "r": [
    [
     "Materials can combine with vibrancy to add visual interest to the interface."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "ba85a60c-3db4-42e4-997b-ca85cda98577",
   "r": [
    [
     "材质可以与活力结合，"
    ],
    [
     "增加界面的视觉趣味",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "0c6557f0-6632-4551-a878-63fcba941ae0",
   "r": [
    [
     "Where 用在哪里",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "1da67d7d-8e8a-4371-9177-dcc3eea7674b",
   "r": [
    [
     "iOS、iPadOS上的原生对话框、提示"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "202333e5-955a-4b77-bd53-f5933cb9d707",
   "r": [
    [
     "Untitled"
    ]
   ],
   "file": "layout-materials/07.jpg",
   "w": 1600,
   "h": 520
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "91b51fc5-bb0f-4137-aa4d-e48877fedc51",
   "r": [
    [
     "图源：@fenx",
     [
      [
       "h",
       "gray"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "6afc5406-25ee-4e90-95d5-bc98ede04ea2",
   "r": [
    [
     "watchOS"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "c9b2bae7-f3bc-4768-bb4f-7f4a0232024a",
   "r": [
    [
     "暂不支持这个材质效果。",
     [
      [
       "s"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "f0b3f3f7-4213-4624-b9e3-4bcfd0d4c1df",
   "r": [
    [
     "macOS"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "b04b4533-6426-4fb1-9a12-514cfeb451d9",
   "r": [
    [
     "在macOS中有两种混合模式，一种在窗口背后，另一种是和窗口融合。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "1fb5e3ff-c524-4964-addc-04308442a549",
   "r": [
    [
     "Untitled"
    ]
   ],
   "file": "layout-materials/08.jpg",
   "w": 1600,
   "h": 1000
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "cfa1216b-9360-4e3d-93e8-cb1c86a29b0c",
   "r": [
    [
     "这是第一种，在这种模式下，窗口后面的内容会显示出来，帮助用户保留围绕你的应用程序或游戏的一些上下文。"
    ],
    [
     "菜单、工作表和侧栏等组件自动使用此模式",
     [
      [
       "b"
      ]
     ]
    ],
    [
     "。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "799185b6-248b-4ebe-868c-17ceb37065f5",
   "r": [
    [
     "Untitled"
    ]
   ],
   "file": "layout-materials/09.jpg",
   "w": 1600,
   "h": 1000
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "3f473098-4757-4bb9-bce7-90de93c9c989",
   "r": [
    [
     "这是第二种，在这个模式下，允许通过其他窗口组件显示窗口内容。例如，当窗口内容在工具栏下滚动时，工具栏可以使用这种模式，给人一种连续性的感觉。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "745bfae0-07bc-4191-ac9d-7f62a8e562f7",
   "r": [
    [
     " tvOS"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "bef6c442-0ae7-457c-b385-c276a5ceb525",
   "r": [
    [
     "定义和iOS类似，没有过多展开。",
     [
      [
       "s"
      ]
     ]
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "callout",
   "id": "06dc9570-0d75-4605-8354-84ba70c91d74",
   "r": [
    [
     "对于移动端app的产品设计师来说，这一章内容派上用场的地方并不多，能够理解官方对于毛玻璃材质的四种定义就足够了。"
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal_background",
   "icon": "💡"
  }
 ]
}
